  "```lean\nInt.toNat : ℤ → ℕ\n```\n***\nTurns an integer into a natural number, negative numbers become\n`0`.\n\n```\n#eval (7 : Int).toNat -- 7\n#eval (0 : Int).toNat -- 0\n#eval (-7 : Int).toNat -- 0\n```\n\n***\n*import Init.Data.Int.Basic*",
